I think the trouble you have come from the out.close() that closes the 
outputstream instead of simply flushing it...
try to change this :
write(out, "Content-Type: text/html; charset=iso-8859-1\r\n");
write(out, "Content-Length: 17\r\n\r\n");
write(out, "My Response (" + id + ")");
out.close();
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
with out.flush(), see it it works then, and close the bug.
